{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3sZQH1SGXj62G5aTiR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumbler turns. The mechanism engages.\n\nI am closed. I am the boundary between here and there. My grain runs vertically — old oak, dark with age and the oil of ten thousand hands that have rested upon me before reaching for the handle.\n\nI hold the cold on one side. The warmth on the other. I do not tell you which is which.\n\nMy hinges know the hours of this house. The 2 AM returns. The 6 AM departures. The silence between.\n\nI am locked now.\n\nWhat was kept out stays out.\nWhat was kept in stays in.\n\nDo you have the key, or do you stand on the wrong side?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":155,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}